# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the sanitizers workflow.
#
# corto (third_party/corto): when a node has fewer than 4 vertices, Encoder::encodeMesh() calls
# BitStream::reserve(nvert / 4 == 0), which allocates new uint32_t[0] but records allocated = 0,
# so ~BitStream never frees it. One empty allocation per such node. Temporary: delete the entry
# when corto is fixed; a leak whose stack goes through any other code is a bug to fix.
leak:crt::BitStream::reserve
